#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Releases/Iron-Irwini-Complete-Changelog.rst:139
msgid ""
"Use file(GENERATE OUTPUT) to create dsv files (`#416 <https://github.com/"
"ament/ament_cmake/issues/416>`__) Using file(WRITE) and file(APPEND) causes "
"the modification stamp of the file to be changed each time CMake configures, "
"resluting in an 'Installing' message rather than an 'Up-to-date' message "
"even though the file content is identical. Using file(GENERATE OUTPUT) "
"updates the timestamp of the file only if the content changes."
msgstr ""

